Modifications in this product

The upstream tool contracts and analysis operations have been adapted into a
standalone, headless Java MCP server. Changes include the MCP transport,
workspace input management, stable node identities, lazy source generation,
source caching, and persistent renames and comments with source verification.

Bundled components

The binary distribution includes JADX, the Model Context Protocol Java SDK,
Gson, and their bundled dependencies. See the license, copyright, and notice
resources distributed with the JAR for their respective terms and attributions.

